OL,3,GNEWSAFirst all-female beach lifeguard
OL,4,Atraining camp
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of women are taking part in the
OL,7,Fthe RNLI's first all-female lifeguard
OL,8,Ftraining camp.
OL,10,FThe camp in Newquay, Cornwall, comes as
OL,11,Fwomen make up 31% of RNLI lifeguards, a
OL,12,Ffigure the charity is hoping to grow.
OL,14,FMillie Coates from Bude is one of those
OL,15,Fspending the week learning new rescue
OL,16,Fskills and honing existing ones. Others
OL,17,Fhave travelled hundreds of miles to
OL,18,Ftake part.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
