OL,3,GNEWSAFirst all-female beach lifeguard
OL,4,Atraining camp
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Coates, one of the biggest benefits
OL,7,Fhas been meeting women who understand
OL,8,Fthe job and the challenges that can
OL,9,Fcome with it.
